OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover demolition junction to
OL,4,Areopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road junction is due to reopen
OL,7,Fafter the demolition of the flyover
OL,8,Fthat ran above it, hopefully ending
OL,9,Fweeks of disruption to drivers,
OL,10,Fresidents and businesses.
OL,12,FThe Park Lane roundabout in Gateshead
OL,13,Fhas been shut since 25 July to allow
OL,14,Fdemolition crews to tear down a section
OL,15,Fof the abandoned road above it.
OL,17,FThe junction, which links the Felling
OL,18,FBypass to the Tyne Bridge, is expected
OL,19,Fto reopen on Friday evening. While an
OL,20,Fexact time has not been confirmed, it
OL,21,Fis expected to be after rush hour.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
