OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover demolition junction to
OL,4,Areopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FGateshead Council's strategic director
OL,7,Ffor economy Anneliese Hutchinson said
OL,8,Fthe authority recognised the closure
OL,9,Fhad been "very challenging for
OL,10,Feveryone".
